# Never uploaded by `railway up`: secrets, databases, backups, uploads, dependencies and build output, test suites
# and harnesses. Deploy from a folder made by server/scripts/make-release.mjs, which contains none of these anyway;
# this file is a second barrier. Keep in step with .dockerignore.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!server/.env.example
**/node_modules
/dist
server/dist
server/data
server/backups
**/uploads
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db.json
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.pem
**/*.key
/.acceptance
server/src/tests
/tests
/scripts
